OL,3,GNEWSATheatre and museum to reopen after
OL,4,A#19m revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Victorian theatre and museum is set
OL,7,Fto reopen following a #19m revamp.
OL,9,FThe Grade II-listed Stephenson Memorial
OL,10,FHall in Chesterfield, Derbyshire,
OL,11,Fclosed for refurbishment in 2022 and
OL,12,Fwill open its doors once again on 1
OL,13,FDecember.
OL,15,FChesterfield Borough Council said the
OL,16,F625-seat Pomegranate Theatre has been
OL,17,Frewired and refurbished with a new
OL,18,Finternal layout, heating and
OL,19,Fventilation system, roof, restored
OL,20,Fhistoric features and improved
OL,21,Faccessibility.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
