OL,3,GNEWSATheatre and museum to reopen after
OL,4,A#19m revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe museum has been expanded to host
OL,7,Ftouring shows and has upgraded two bars
OL,8,Fand "flexible spaces" for meetings and
OL,9,Fevents.
